[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3734007259","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114843#issuecomment-3734007259","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114843","id":3734007259,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ekG3b","user":{"login":"TranquilMarmot","id":504259,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDI1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/504259?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot","html_url":"https://github.com/TranquilMarmot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-11T04:46:12Z","updated_at":"2026-01-11T09:41:51Z","body":"Okay, looking at the code for these:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/85c75da4ad8a01e1f9e25620872560293ac70b51/core/input/input.cpp#L594-L616\n\nthey do just return `joy_vibration[p_device]` which is only set when calling `start_joy_vibration`:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/85c75da4ad8a01e1f9e25620872560293ac70b51/core/input/input.cpp#L1030\n\nThis has been that way for ~10 years now, so changing it seems a bit risky.\n\nThere's also a `get_joy_vibration_timestamp` method that is _not_ exposed to gdscript right now.\n\nI see these as the options:\n1. Change the behavior of `get_joy_vibration_strength` / `get_joy_vibration_duration` to return the _current_ state of the controller\n   - _Probably not:_ This would be a breaking change\n2. Expose `get_joy_vibration_timestamp` to GDScript\n   - Smallest change, lets people manually calculate if a vibration is still going\n3. Implement `get_joy_vibration_current_strength` / `get_joy_vibration_remaining_duration`\n   - `get_joy_vibration_current_strength` would return the vibration strength, or `(0, 0)` if it has stopped\n   - `get_joy_vibration_remaining_duration` would return how long the vibration has until it stops\n   - Also, go update the docs for `get_joy_vibration_strength` / `get_joy_vibration_duration` to specify what they actually return (not \"current\")","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3734007259/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3734011524","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114843#issuecomment-3734011524","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114843","id":3734011524,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ekH6E","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-11T04:53:04Z","updated_at":"2026-01-11T04:53:04Z","body":"> 1. Change the behavior of `get_joy_vibration_strength` / `get_joy_vibration_duration` to return the _current_ state of the controller\n>    \n>    * _Probably not:_ This would be a breaking change\n\nIf we do the first option, it will break compatibility. The other two options look fine.\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3734011524/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3738178009","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114843#issuecomment-3738178009","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114843","id":3738178009,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7e0BHZ","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-12T11:49:04Z","updated_at":"2026-01-12T13:45:30Z","body":"Another possible option is to create `Input.is_joy_vibrating()` method (maybe `Input.has_joy_vibration()` too for that matter?).\nAnd I think the current behaviour also needs to be documented, should be easy enough to fix!","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3738178009/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3739589049","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114843#issuecomment-3739589049","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114843","id":3739589049,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7e5Zm5","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-12T17:09:26Z","updated_at":"2026-01-12T17:09:26Z","body":"> `get_joy_vibration_remaining_duration` would return how long the vibration has until it stops\n\nWhat should this method return if the vibration should be indefinite? `-1`?\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/788beb36dc54ee4307a32d52e4895017d3620375/doc/classes/Input.xml#L434\n> [param duration] is the duration of the effect in seconds (a duration of 0 will try to play the vibration indefinitely).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3739589049/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3741346614","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114843#issuecomment-3741346614","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114843","id":3741346614,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7fAGs2","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-13T01:26:59Z","updated_at":"2026-01-13T01:26:59Z","body":"> What should this method return if the vibration should be indefinite? `-1`?\n\nIt should return `-1` because it seems to be the best option.\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3741346614/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3743815343","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114843#issuecomment-3743815343","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114843","id":3743815343,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7fJhav","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-13T11:26:10Z","updated_at":"2026-01-13T12:29:15Z","body":"Although, I'm not entirely sure `get_joy_vibration_remaining_duration` is necessary, I think it can be replaced with something like this:\n```gdscript\nvar vibration_timer: SceneTreeTimer\n\nfunc vibrate(duration: float) -> void:\n    Input.start_joy_vibration(0, 1, 1, duration)\n    vibration_timer = get_tree().create_timer(duration)\n\nfunc get_joy_vibration_remaining_duration() -> float:\n    return vibration_timer.time_left\n```\nOr if the programmer only needs to wait until the vibration is over:\n```gdscript\nInput.start_joy_vibration(0, 1, 1, duration)\nawait get_tree().create_timer(duration).timeout\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3743815343/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3745706733","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114843#issuecomment-3745706733","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114843","id":3745706733,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7fQvLt","user":{"login":"TranquilMarmot","id":504259,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDI1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/504259?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot","html_url":"https://github.com/TranquilMarmot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-13T18:10:50Z","updated_at":"2026-01-13T18:10:55Z","body":"@Nintorch the reason I ran into this was because I had two different scripts in different parts of the scene tree that are triggering vibration and wanted to check if vibration was still running before triggering it again. I do agree that you could wrap it up in your own singleton to do the vibration, but it would be nice if this was \"batteries included\" especially since we have all the info required already store in memory.\n\n> Another possible option is to create `Input.is_joy_vibrating()`\n\nI like this idea, too. I still think there is value in returning the time remaining 🤷 ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3745706733/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3745851344","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114843#issuecomment-3745851344","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114843","id":3745851344,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7fRSfQ","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-13T18:48:05Z","updated_at":"2026-01-13T18:48:05Z","body":"Alright then! :D It shouldn't be hard to implement!","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3745851344/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]